  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="e6672150-f854-5113-aa1e-99c602f2d969" activityNameId="c704668d-2681-5542-bd42-a5ee7ef5fe6d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Passenger car, electric, city car, without battery, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Passenger car, electric, city car, without battery, at plant
The data set reflects a BEV of 650kg total weight with a 100kg battery (not included in this dataset) and 70kg electric motor;
UUID: 7c7dc323-079e-392a-b3df-b184566f1413
The inventory includes  processes of  material, energy and water use in vehicle manufacturing. Rail and road transport of materials is accounted for. Plant infrastructure is included, addressing issues such as land use, building, road and parking construction. Additionally, battery and electric motor manufacture is included. Furthermore, inputs for lead acid batteries were excluded. For BEVs the tank and combustion motor input is excluded as well. The battery is excluded and needs to be accounted for separately in the transport process.
Location: Data for manufacturing and retail in Europe
Technology: light weight construction, max. 4 Persons
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literture 
Extrapolations: All values extrapolated from passenger car manufacture using weight ratio. Some adaptations made for change of material.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7c7dc323-079e-392a-b3df-b184566f1413.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
